      "id": 4,
      "title": "Sample Curated Book",
      "content": "I. The Lantern\n\nA lantern is a small promise. It says that someone expects to come back this way, and expects the dark to be waiting when they do.\n\nII. The Road\n\nThe road out of the village was older than the village. It bent where the river had once bent, though the river had long since changed its mind.",
